sequenceDiagram
    participant Teacher
    participant Frontend
    participant Gateway
    participant ResourceSvc
    participant Storage
    participant PreviewWorker

    Teacher->>Frontend: 选择文件上传
    Frontend->>Gateway: POST /resources
    Gateway->>ResourceSvc: 校验权限
    ResourceSvc->>Storage: 上传对象
    Storage-->>ResourceSvc: 返回存储 URL
    ResourceSvc->>ResourceSvc: 新建资源版本
    ResourceSvc->>PreviewWorker: 发布生成预览任务
    PreviewWorker->>Storage: 拉取原始文件
    PreviewWorker-->>Storage: 上传预览文件
    PreviewWorker->>ResourceSvc: 更新预览状态
    ResourceSvc-->>Teacher: 上传成功
